  "fullContentHtml": "<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 225px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%; text-align: center; height: 36px; border-style: none;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Name Of Post :</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%; height: 36px; border-style: none;\">\n<h1>UPCATET Admissions 2026 Apply Online Form</h1>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%; text-align: center; height: 35px; border-style: none;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Post Date / Update :</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%; height: 35px; border-style: none;\">11 May 2026</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 154px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%; text-align: center; height: 154px; border-style: none;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information </strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%; height: 154px; border-style: none; vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Banda University of Agriculture &amp; Technology, Banda has Released UPCATET Admissions 2026 Notification. Those candidates who are interested in this UPCATET Various UG, PG &amp; Other Courses Admissions 2026 can Apply Online from 30/03/2026 to 15/05/2026. Read the notification for admissions eligibility, post information, selection procedure, pay scale and all other information.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"social-grid\">\n\n<div class=\"social-box telegram\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2111/2111646.png\">\n        <span>Telegram</span>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"https://t.me/SarkariResult2012\" class=\"social-btn\">Join Us</a>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"social-box whatsapp\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/733/733585.png\">\n        <span>WhatsApp</span>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"https://www.whatsapp.com/channel/0029Va5IElwBlHpVBd6i5a18\" class=\"social-btn\">Join Us</a>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"social-box instagram\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2111/2111463.png\">\n        <span>Instagram</span>\n    </div>\n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"social-box twitter\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/5968/5968958.png\">\n        <span>X</span>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"https://x.com/srofficial2012\" class=\"social-btn\">Follow</a>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div id=\"v-sarkariresult\"></div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-48617a69 gb-headline-text\"><p>Name of Post:</p>\n<h1>UPCATET Admissions 2026 Apply Online Form</h1>\n<p>Post Date / Update:11 May 2026 | 11:19 AMShort Information :<a title=\"UPCATET\" href=\"https://upcatetexam.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Banda University of Agriculture &amp; Technology, Banda </span></a> has Released UPCATET Admissions 2026 Notification. Those candidates who are interested in this UPCATET Various UG, PG &amp; Other Courses Admissions 2026 can Apply Online from 30/03/2026 to 15/05/2026. Read the notification for admissions eligibility, post information, selection procedure, pay scale and all other information.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table border=\"1\" width=\"829\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Banda University of Agriculture &amp; Technology, Banda (BUAT)&nbsp;&nbsp;(Conducted University)<br>\n</span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>U.P. Combined Agriculture and Technology Entrance Test 2026</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>UPCATET Exam 2026 : Short Details of Notification</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b></b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"350\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Application Begin :<b>30/03/2026</b></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online :<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>15/05/2026</strong></span></li>\n<li>Pay Exam Fee Last Date<b> : 15/05/2026</b></li>\n<li>Correction Date : <b>02-15 May 2026</b></li>\n<li>UPCATET 2026 Exam Date :<strong>17-18 June 2026</strong></li>\n<li>Admit Card Issue :<b>10 June 2026</b></li>\n<li>Result Declared :<b>24/06/2026</b></li>\n<li>Counselling Start : <strong>July 2026</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"370\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>General / OBC / EWS : <b>1350/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST : <b>1100/-</b></li>\n<li>Pay the Exam Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking or Pay Offline Through E Challan Fee Mode Only</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>UPCATET Admission 2026 : <span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Age Limit as on</span> <span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">31/12/2026</span></b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>BVSc &amp; AH Course : <b>17-25 Years.</b></li>\n<li>Other Ug Courses : <b>16-22 Years.</b></li>\n<li>PG Courses : <b>No Age Limit </b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>UPCATET 2026 Admissions Course List with Eligibility &nbsp;</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Course Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>UPCATET Course Wise Eligibility</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\n<p align=\"center\">B.Sc Agriculture</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\n<p align=\"center\">10+2 with PAG, PCM, PCB, PCMB</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\n<p align=\"center\">B.Sc Horticulture</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\n<p align=\"center\">B.Sc Forestry</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\n<p align=\"center\">Do.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\n<p align=\"center\">B.F.S.c (Fisheries Science)</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\n<p align=\"center\">10+2 with PAG, PCB, PCMB</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\n<p align=\"center\">B.V.Sc &amp; AH</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\n<p align=\"center\">10+2 with PCB / PCMB with English and 50% Aggregate Marks in Each Group Subject</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\n<p align=\"center\">B.Sc Community Science (Girls)</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\n<p align=\"center\">10+2 in Arts Stream with Home Science As a Subject / PAG /PCB/PCM/PCMB</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\n<p align=\"center\">B.Tech Biotechnology</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\n<p align=\"center\">10+2 with PAG, PCM, PCB, PCMB</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\n<p align=\"center\">B.Tech Agriculture</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\n<p align=\"center\">10+2 with PAG, PCM, PCMB</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\n<p align=\"center\">B.Tech Dairy / Food Technology</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\n<p align=\"center\">10+2 with PAG, PCB, PCMB</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\n<p align=\"center\">B.Tech Sugarcane Science and Technology</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\n<p align=\"center\">10+2 with PAG, PCB &amp; PCM</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\n<p align=\"center\">B.Tech &nbsp;Food Nutrition and Dietetics</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\n<p align=\"center\">10+2 with PHS , PCB &amp; PCM</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\n<p align=\"center\">Post Graduate Courses (Master Degree)</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\n<p align=\"center\">Bachelor Degree Passed / Appearing</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"363\">\n<p align=\"center\">PHd Courses</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"356\">\n<p align=\"center\">Master Degree Passed / Appearing</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>How to Fill UPCATET 2026 Admission Online Form</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Step 1 : New Registration at https://upcatetexam.org/</li>\n<li>Step 2 : Login (Filling Information, Qualification Details, Upload Document)</li>\n<li>Step 3 : Application Fees Payment</li>\n<li>Step 4 : Print Application Form</li>\n<li><b>Photo Instruction :</b> Recently Passport Size Photograph with Candidate Name, Father Name and Photo Taken Date</li>\n<li>Take a 15 Print of Photograph (For Sample Read the Notification Page No. 27)</li>\n<li>Signature Scan in Black Ball Pen Only</li>\n<li><strong>University List :</strong> ANDUA&amp;T Kumarganj Ayodhya, CSAUA&amp;T Kanpur, SVPUA&amp;T Meerut &amp; BUA&amp;T, Banda</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\"><center><br>\n<!-- 300 x 250 mar 23 --><br>\n<br>\n</center><p></p>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>UP CATET Admission Exam City / District Details 2026</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ayodhya, Agra, Bareilly, Banda, Kanpur, Meerut, Varanasi, Azamgarh, Jhansi, Lucknow, Gorakhpur &amp; Prayagraj</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Interested Candidate Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply Online.</span><br>\n</b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"375\">\n\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"345\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"720\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"368\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Apply Online</span><br>\n</b></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"351\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><a title=\"UPCATET 2026 Registration\" href=\"https://onlineapp.upcatetexam.org/frm_signup.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Registration</a> | <a title=\"UPCATET Admission 2026 Login\" href=\"https://onlineapp.upcatetexam.org/frm_student_login.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Login</a></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"368\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download Notification</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"351\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"368\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008080;\">Image Resizer, JPG to PDF, Photo Name Date Maker, Resume CV Maker and More Tools<br>\n</span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"351\">\n<h2 align=\"cente